            "title": "Tesla Cybertruck's 10th recall in 2 yrs, CoreWeave bid rejected",
            "description": "<p>Yahoo Finance anchor <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/\">Julie Hyman</a> tracks Thursday's top moving stocks and biggest market stories in this<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\"> Market Minute</a>.</p>\n<p>Mortgage rates decreased for the fourth week in a row, with the 30-year fixed rate now at 6.17%, according to the newest data from Freddie Mac (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/FMCC\">FMCC</a>).</p>\n<p>CoreWeave's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CRWV\">CRWV</a>) $9 billion acquisition bid for Core Scientific (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CORZ\">CORZ</a>) was rejected.</p>\n<p>Tesla (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/TSLA\">TSLA</a>) Cybertruck was recalled for the 10th time in two years, according to the National Highway and Traffic Safety Administration.</p>\n<p>Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with <a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\">Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.</a></p>",
