            "title": "Trump wants more homebuilding: Can Fannie Mae, Freddie Mac help?",
            "description": "<p>President Trump has called on Fannie Mae (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/FNMA\">FNMA</a>) and Freddie Mac (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/FMCC\">FMCC</a>) to kickstart homebuilding again.</p>\n<p>Real estate and finance professor at the University of Pennsylvania's Wharton School and co-director at the Penn Institute for Urban Research, Susan Wachter, joins Market Domination host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/josh-lipton/\">Josh Lipton</a> to discuss the future of homebuilding.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination/\">Market Domination</a>.</p>",
